    {
      "uid": "zhcn:216a5c7c5d9d559b87f80f49",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "产生这个念头的瞬间，我感到\n被安宁包裹的身体逐渐失去了力气……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cb592adb107e6059d5affe45a3333ddedfe045282514ae67fd6c67b7d1bc93c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074805.json",
