    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:838d9711bccc8427d9485d9f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……得继续工作了",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f3f91818ce7d9d4b08cd7191e8c55dbbee14d37d6f8575b4dd4a3b9bd4fbe04",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074805.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00e3b894eb36de98b003505e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看来我只睡了一小会儿。\n大概是因为刚才放松了警惕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6da4eae93fb658b6c8058f4076493eadc3d63316b299d020fb75c55c02f00b2d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074805.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8111ab7a5c7d2b92e01583f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我连忙坐到电脑前，重新开始工作。\n这时――",
      "source_fingerprint": "58c689a2116c98f6b41e3e76eef2554432bb128fb19edd79a6e8b7faccbdf6e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074805.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c56a53fdc737a7cdb3f200d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "思路顺畅得令人惊讶，\n文字也开始源源不断地涌现。\n看来疲劳恢复的效果十分显著。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6146c7ddc6594d9e786d882e004c359bbc6fe68f6a1dafd8d58df0b41b77aa8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074805.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03443fec3a2b74118f1d71c8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谢谢……这样我又能继续努力了",
      "source_fingerprint": "acd44516197dec0f74e19c8c1240a1ba3eddb13b91adbde5c044dd21b2a778ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074805.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c70fa951ff5132c0ce433d70",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白光明",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cce4d859896c50ae77983029951d94a41ba9369dc531a5184d37f6b802e9b98",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074805.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
