    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e306a823e5228dd991a9eedd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……哎呀～？\n训练员大人～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cef97fa8279ca31d78688be6dfd7c2714b5e15d7e64464c068367d7beff7c61a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074805.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4742f45e8ed5c03ffb98ead",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "已经……撑不住了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fa2013902928e63fe9a47917c021beb3cfbe01e8c12082456bc18d97c04eed9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074805.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1361b492a7fbf022615d581",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她那温柔舒缓的声音\n宛如摇篮曲一般作用在眼皮上……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b43b19cf9617da78b6186b011b381818d3bd58232a41038b7b15c6e25e98acaa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074805.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cbffb14ed616f27ac4094cb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "意识就这样坠入浅眠。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b9414fce3c29edbf5d32920555c0cd93e2c6e303a23aff1eb96df034181d2ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074805.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9da87f4148fa81daea2d741c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我突然醒了过来。\n看了眼时钟，似乎已经睡了两小时。",
      "source_fingerprint": "acdab3bdcd90f410e65830cd30ee587b87479a5a83d36f857503d72178003e1f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074805.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01ed16d6a325a5435ef63ed8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哇，光明！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5510d7de1084379779bf7314d8b33582c5c7c0ceeda57885cb4c4db71913fff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074805.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33896c7d96c244343586aa2e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白光明",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cce4d859896c50ae77983029951d94a41ba9369dc531a5184d37f6b802e9b98",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
